{"messageId":"019bc20a15947edeb4595cd4745c87c3","rawEvent":{"message_id":"019bc20a15947edeb4595cd4745c87c3","conversation_id":"019bc209ce0e7dabae140886bebf94a1","content":"我发现问题了！`ValueStrSlice` 方法的实现有问题。

